Package: com.zeshan.phoneaura
Name: PhoneAura
Version: 0.4.9
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: PhoneAura is a free, modern redesign of the iOS 16 Phone app. Version 0.4.9 adds live saved-contact suggestions while dialing and a one-tap clipboard Paste button to the redesigned keypad, alongside custom Favorites, smart Recents filters, call details, Contacts, swipe-to-delete controls, haptics and fluid animations. Available for RootHide and rootless jailbreaks.
